// 007.3: `Duty d … Overridden by d'` is not violated while an instance of `d'` holds that shares the components the two duties have in common (by name); other instances of `d` are unaffected.
Fact actor Identified by Alice, Bob
Duty emergency Holder actor Claimant actor1.
Duty quiet Holder actor Claimant actor1 Overridden by emergency Violated when True.
+quiet(Alice, Bob).
?Violated(quiet(Alice, Bob)).
+emergency(Alice, Bob).
?!Violated(quiet(Alice, Bob)).
+quiet(Bob, Alice).
?Violated(quiet(Bob, Alice)).
-emergency(Alice, Bob).
?Violated(quiet(Alice, Bob)).
